<p>
  Hello,
</p>

<p>
  This is a reminder:
  <strong><%= @minor_name %></strong> invited you to be their parent or
  guardian on Fuime, a financial platform for teen-run businesses, and
  the invitation is still waiting.
</p>

<% if @stage == :day6 %>
  <p>
    The link expires
    <strong><%= @expires_at ? l(@expires_at.to_date, format: :long) : "soon" %></strong>.
    After that they will need a new invite.
  </p>
<% end %>

<p>
  Until you accept, they can sell but they cannot get paid. Accepting
  makes you the legal signer and responsible adult for their venture.
</p>

<p>
  Review the invitation and the guardian agreement here:
</p>

<p>
  <%= link_to "Review guardian invitation", @accept_url,
              style: "display:inline-block;background:#2242FF;color:#ffffff;padding:12px 20px;text-decoration:none;border-radius:8px;font-weight:600;" %>
</p>

<p style="word-break: break-all;">
  Or paste this link into your browser:<br>
  <%= link_to @accept_url, @accept_url %>
</p>

<p>
  If you already accepted, you can ignore this. If you did not expect
  this invitation, or if you do not know <%= @minor_name %>, you can
  ignore this email. Nothing happens unless you accept.
</p>

<p>
  Questions? Reply to this email or write to <%= @support_email %>.
</p>

<p>
  Thanks,<br>
  The Fuime team
</p>
